{"title":"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Pete sets up 12 hurdles for a race that is 600 metres long. The distance between the starting line and the first hurdle is 50 metres. The distance between the last hurdle and the finishing line is 55 metres. The distance between each pair of consecutive hurdles is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> metres. What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> hurdles, there would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> gaps between the hurdles. Each gap is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> metres in length and the gaps between two of the known hurdles are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> metres and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> metres, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/c/dec369180b66302626df0023d34efcaa9a68255d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 + 11d + 55 = 600$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"162\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/0/8e0aecd66d02fd3a5a4a9c594307971aaca0cadc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11d + 105 = 600$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f34c9b0cea0aed71103dd39c4f89e2134a6ee082.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11d = 600 - 105 = 495$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"182\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/e/c7e1930a735149fc79a77c8749faa3e98b5b1853.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = \\frac{495}{11} = \\boxed{45}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC\" title=\"2016 CIMC\">2016 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=